<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>This function clears the command list for a given object. Note that this also clears the currently executed command which is outside of the queue.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>Designers should NOT use this function, but use the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/WR%20ClearAllCommands" title="WR ClearAllCommands">WR_ClearAllCommands</a> wrapper function instead, defined in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Wrappers%20h" title="Wrappers h">wrappers_h</a>
</p>
